[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0010","text":"呵呵……\n找到了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0020","text":"抱歉凛世酱，马上就好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0030","text":"不……\n直到拍到好照片为止……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0040","text":"──嘿嘿，谢谢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0050","text":"劳烦你了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0060","text":"好……要拍了……\n３……２……１……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0070","text":"下次请务必……\n摆和广告里一样的姿势……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0080","text":"OK！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0090","text":"──那最后！\n凛世酱，我们一起拍吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0100","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
